<title>UK: Elf and Gulf say committed to UK refinery merger.</title>
<headline>Elf and Gulf say committed to UK refinery merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf-Aquitaine and Chevron Corp's Gulf said on Thursday that they remain committed to the merger of their U.K. refinery operations despite the decision by Murco Petroleum Ltd, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Murphy Oil Corp, to withdraw.</p>
</text>
